{"asset_key":"ep8/quest_story_18107621","episode":"ep8","category":"quest_story","story_id":"18107621","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"say:0:1810762101:0":{"text":"爱丝将解药交到了里纳手中。然而，里纳却似乎有些犹豫。","source_cn":"爱丝将解药交到了里纳手中。然而，里纳却似乎有些犹豫。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6E5E3C54218FCA8D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1810762102:1":{"text":"怎么了？这瓶药有什么不对吗？","source_cn":"怎么了？这瓶药有什么不对吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x700B78B3C1061D53","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1810762103:1":{"text":"不……不是。我只是有点……犹豫。","source_cn":"不……不是。我只是有点……犹豫。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x03AE6A7586BE86EE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:6:1810762103":{"text":"不……不是。我只是有点……犹豫。","source_cn":"不……不是。我只是有点……犹豫。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x03AE6A7586BE86EE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1810762104:1":{"text":"……我害怕恢复记忆以后，就会理解你和瑟恩所做的一切。","source_cn":"……我害怕恢复记忆以后，就会理解你和瑟恩所做的一切。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9867B90CD9EF2CF7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1810762105:1":{"text":"可是这样……或许对穆婆婆不公平。","source_cn":"可是这样……或许对穆婆婆不公平。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3E7D007E36FA8231","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1810762106:1":{"text":"我不奢求你的理解和原谅。下定决心阻拦你的那一刻，我就已经做好了准备。","source_cn":"我不奢求你的理解和原谅。下定决心阻拦你的那一刻，我就已...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE3F7FD8F5EFD785B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1810762107:1":{"text":"你也可以拒绝恢复记忆，以“里纳”的身份继续活下去。","source_cn":"你也可以拒绝恢复记忆，以“里纳”的身份继续活下去。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE4B57456786B16EA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1810762108:1":{"text":"………………\n你明知道“巴登”不会这样做。","source_cn":"………………\\n你明知道“巴登”不会这样做。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC9D72C8AD238A2D4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1810762109:1":{"text":"无论你作何选择，我都不会有怨言。我已发誓守护爱丝和瑞恩家族，至死方休。","source_cn":"无论你作何选择，我都不会有怨言。我已发誓守护爱丝和瑞恩...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x516A1B4F3F1764E6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1810762110:1":{"text":"……","source_cn":"……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC4D94AD9463C9058","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1810762111:0":{"text":"巴登先生……不，里纳先生。若你不介意，请听听我作为亡灵的想法。","source_cn":"巴登先生……不，里纳先生。若你不介意，请听听我作为亡灵...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1B78D79AB13E0643","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1810762112:0":{"text":"虽然不清楚事情的具体经过，但我想，穆婆婆所做的一切必定都由她主动，出自她的本心。包括牺牲自己、拯救你的决定。","source_cn":"虽然不清楚事情的具体经过，但我想，穆婆婆所做的一切必定...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4C23C86BA8942DA7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1810762113:0":{"text":"毕竟她对你的爱护，每一位修缮屋的客人都有目共睹。","source_cn":"毕竟她对你的爱护，每一位修缮屋的客人都有目共睹。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x837FF8EBFBBA2DCF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1810762114:1":{"text":"就是因为这样，我才无法原谅自己……！","source_cn":"就是因为这样，我才无法原谅自己……！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA75BFDC342FBAAFC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1810762115:1":{"text":"我明白你的痛苦。但这不是生命的终点。","source_cn":"我明白你的痛苦。但这不是生命的终点。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x387D53938AB0A775","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_fe